  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Connectivity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB Invest is considering providing financing up to US$15,000,000 to a future rural mobile infrastructure operator IPT SAC (&quot;IPT&quot;), which currently has Telef&#xF3;nica del Per&#xFA; and potentially other (&#x201C;DFIs&#x201D;) as shareholders. The company aims to sustainably connect the unconnected and underserved populations of Peru through an innovative rural connectivity business model.IDB Invest&apos;s investment would be subject to certain conditions being met, including the Company agreeing to comply with IDB Invest&apos;s environment and social policies whilst IDB Invest is a shareholder.</narrative>
  </description>
